      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِسْهَجٌ</span></b>  One <i>who runs on, in speech, like the
wind:</i> (JK:) <i>eloquent;</i> or <i>fluent in speech:</i> (O,
K, TA:) applied to an orator; (JK, T, TA;) as
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِسْهَكٌ</span>. (T, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And One <i>who speaks
on every true and false subject.</i> (O, K.)

